     <bridgehead>
-      <anchor xml:id=3D"VEhA"/> selma'o VEhA (<xref linkend=3D"chapter-ten=
ses-section-interval-sizes"/>)
+      <anchor xml:id=3D"VEhA"/> selma'o VEhA (<xref linkend=3D"section-int=
erval-sizes"/>)
     </bridgehead>
    =20
     <para>A tense indicating the size of an interval in space (long, mediu=
m, or short).</para>
